Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.42,0:22:41.38,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(200,320)}One day the light of love burning in your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.38,0:22:43.30,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}will transcend time
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:47.37,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}and destroy one of this world's dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.37,0:22:51.01,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}as it spirals toward the apocalypse
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.01,0:22:53.86,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}What is it that you seek
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.86,0:22:57.43,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}now that you're done hesitating?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.43,0:23:02.49,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}Is there a glimpse of hope for tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.49,0:23:06.93,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,620)}beyond this greedy admiration?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.05,0:23:12.14,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(200,320)}I want to be armed with the power
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.14,0:23:15.95,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}to shatter even the darkness in my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.95,0:23:19.79,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}just like the ancient magic in my childhood dreams,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.79,0:23:23.67,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the next time I see your innocent smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.67,0:23:27.46,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}In my trembling hands I hold
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.46,0:23:31.29,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the courage of a plucked flower
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.29,0:23:35.13,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}My feelings are all I can rely on;
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.13,0:23:39.00,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,320)}the prayer that awakens
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.00,0:23:46.70,Ending-Magia-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur2\be4\fad(0,1620)}the light
Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.38,0:00:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You tricked us, didn't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:20.38,0:00:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I distinctly remember asking\Nyou to become a magical girl.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:24.88,0:00:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I just didn't explain precisely\N what would be involved.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:33.64,0:00:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us?!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:35.89,0:00:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You never asked.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:37.90,0:00:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't have bothered you\None bit if you'd never found out.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:41.90,0:00:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami, for example, never did.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:46.86,0:00:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you humans don't even \Nrealize you have souls in the first place.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:52.83,0:00:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Your body's nothing more than a collection of neurons and a centralized cardiovascular system.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:00.63,0:01:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition, when the human body\Nceases to function, the soul is lost.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:06.38,0:01:10.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave your soul a physical form to prevent that from happening—
Dialogue: 5,0:01:10.31,0:01:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,a form you can pick up and\Nprotect with your own hands.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:13.14,0:01:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That way, you can battle\Nwitches with greater safety.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:17.39,0:01:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody asked you to do that!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:20.98,0:01:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You still don't understand what it's like to fight, do you?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:25.25,0:01:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, take the pain you would\Nexperience upon being impaled by a spear.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:43.47,0:01:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is how it would actually feel.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:45.67,0:01:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A single strike would be\Nenough to incapacitate you.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:53.35,0:01:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Pain inhibition was the only reason you\Nremained standing to the end against Kyouko.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:59.52,0:02:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only possible because your consciousness isn't directly linked with your body.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:03.73,0:02:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how you were\Nable to survive that battle.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:14.92,0:02:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In time, you can even learn\Nto completely cut off pain.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:18.50,0:02:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wouldn't recommend that, \Nsince it tends to slow you down.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:24.30,0:02:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 5,0:02:25.50,0:02:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you do this to us?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:27.85,0:02:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You had a wish important enough to commit yourself to a life of battle, did you not?
Dialogue: 5,0:02:32.51,0:02:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And your wish came true, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:38.05,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{OP}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:08.02,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Dialogue: 5,0:04:14.20,0:04:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:16.89,0:04:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bow.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:38.68,0:04:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{**-chan}, did you know about that?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:43.18,0:04:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell us?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:45.90,0:04:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody I've warned has\Never believed me before.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:51.44,0:04:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would Kyubey\N do something so cruel?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:54.44,0:04:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't think it's cruel.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:56.95,0:05:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a creature that doesn't\N understand human values.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:01.13,0:05:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He'd just say it was an appropriate \Npayment for bringing about a miracle.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:06.58,0:05:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not fair at all!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:08.58,0:05:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he do that to her?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:11.47,0:05:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,All Sayaka{**-chan} wanted was to heal the person she loved!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:18.60,0:05:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It was still a miracle.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:21.64,0:05:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He made the impossible possible.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:23.85,0:05:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Miki Sayaka dedicated her entire life to caring for him,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:27.63,0:05:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,he would never have recovered\Nenough to play the violin again.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:31.36,0:05:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally a miracle costs\Nfar more than a human life,
Dialogue: 5,0:05:37.31,0:05:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's the price for\Nwhich Kyubey sells them.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:41.37,0:05:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan} won't be able to go back to her normal life?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:44.62,0:05:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I've said this before, have I not? \NGive up on Miki Sayaka.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:49.12,0:05:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan} saved me!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:53.63,0:05:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If she hadn't been a magical girl at the time,\N Hitomi{**-chan} and I would have died!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:59.59,0:06:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't confuse gratitude with responsibility.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:04.26,0:06:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no way for you to save her.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:07.52,0:06:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're thinking of returning the favor to alleviate your own sense of guilt,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:11.30,0:06:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,then I suggest you reconsider.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:16.03,0:06:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Homura{**-chan}, why are you always so cold?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.04,0:06:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose it's because I'm\Nno longer human as well.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:30.04,0:06:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I visit Kyousuke after being turned into this thing?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:36.57,0:06:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How long are you gonna lie there\Nfeeling sorry for yourself, dummy?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:50.50,0:06:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Come out for a bit.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:52.08,0:06:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We need to talk.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:00.24,0:07:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You regret what was done\N to your body, don't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:08.28,0:07:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think it\Ndoesn't really matter.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:11.62,0:07:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm able to do what I want because I acquired these powers.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:16.16,0:07:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not really something I regret.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:18.76,0:07:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You just got what you deserved.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:21.26,0:07:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! You can just think of it that way.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:24.76,0:07:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If you live only for yourself, \Neverything you do is your own fault.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:28.77,0:07:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no reason to resent others, \Nand you'll never have any regrets.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:33.86,0:07:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get through just about anything if you think of it that way.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:56.08,0:07:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you bring me\Nall the way out here?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:00.33,0:08:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's kind of a long story.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:07.49,0:08:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Want one?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:18.36,0:08:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ever waste food.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:21.17,0:08:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you if you do.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:43.63,0:08:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This place was my dad's church.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:48.52,0:08:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He was an extremely\Nhonest and kind person.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:51.51,0:08:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The type of person who'd cry just\Nfrom reading the morning paper
Dialogue: 5,0:08:55.43,0:08:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and put serious thought into how\Nto make the world a better place.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:59.12,0:09:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad always said that a new \Nreligion was needed to save a new era.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:06.11,0:09:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why he started preaching things that weren't part of the scripture.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:11.93,0:09:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,As you'd expect, people stopped coming to his sermons.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:15.35,0:09:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he got excommunicated by the church.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:17.87,0:09:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No one would listen to what he had to say.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:22.72,0:09:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't have been a surprise.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:24.42,0:09:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,From the outside, it would've\Nlooked like some sketchy cult.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:27.43,0:09:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how right he was,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:29.19,0:09:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter how logical\Nthe things he said were,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:31.68,0:09:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,he was just an outcast\Nin the eyes of society.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:35.68,0:09:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Our whole family was left\Nwith nothing, not even food.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:40.69,0:09:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't accept it.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:42.19,0:09:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad wasn't saying anything wrong.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:45.44,0:09:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It was just different from what\Npeople were used to hearing.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:49.72,0:09:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,If they had just listened to him for five minutes,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:53.45,0:09:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,it would've been obvious that he was right.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:58.36,0:10:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the end, no one listened to him.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:03.42,0:10:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stand it.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:04.88,0:10:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It was unforgivable.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:06.30,0:10:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't bear the fact that\N no one understood him.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:12.55,0:10:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why my wish was that everyone would listen to my dad's words.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:22.74,0:10:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The next morning, his church\N was filled with people.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:27.34,0:10:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The number of believers multiplied at a frightening rate each day,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:31.87,0:10:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and I became yet another magical girl.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:36.69,0:10:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how good his sermons were, \Nthey wouldn't get rid of the witches.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:42.54,0:10:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that was where I came in, so\NI got all hyped up about it like an idiot,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:48.23,0:10:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking we'd save the world together—\Nhe from the light and I from the shadows.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:55.47,0:10:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But one day my dad found\N out what was going on.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:00.10,0:11:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He completely lost it when he realized all his followers were only there because of magic.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:08.07,0:11:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He called me, his own daughter, \Na witch who swayed the hearts of others.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:13.57,0:11:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the irony.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:15.07,0:11:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I was the one who'd been fighting real witches every night.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:20.42,0:11:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That ruined my father.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:23.63,0:11:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He met a pitiful end.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:26.21,0:11:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He started binge drinking,\N lost his grip on reality,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:29.96,0:11:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,and wound up killing\Nhis family, then himself.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:35.14,0:11:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Only I was left.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:41.48,0:11:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My wish destroyed my entire family.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:46.81,0:11:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I made a wish for someone else\Nwithout knowing what he really wanted,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:51.13,0:11:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I ruined many people's lives.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:53.82,0:11:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when I swore to myself that\NI'd never use magic for others again.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:00.33,0:12:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd use my powers only for myself.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:07.98,0:12:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Miracles aren't free.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:10.51,0:12:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wish for hope, an equal amount of despair is scattered across the world.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:15.01,0:12:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It all cancels out to zero. That's how\Nthe balance of the world is maintained.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:20.75,0:12:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you telling me this?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:25.28,0:12:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You just need to stop worrying and do whatever you want.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:28.44,0:12:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Live only for yourself.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:32.09,0:12:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't add up.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:33.81,0:12:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're only living for yourself, \Nthen why worry about me?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:40.78,0:12:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We both started off with the same mistake.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:45.88,0:12:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't start doing\Nmore things you'll regret.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:49.54,0:12:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You've already paid too high\Na price for what you got.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:54.05,0:12:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So now, you should start thinking about how to get your money's worth.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:59.45,0:13:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Like you, huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:01.01,0:13:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:02.49,0:13:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I've come to realize my mistake, \Nbut you're still making yours.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:06.55,0:13:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't watch you go on like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:11.08,0:13:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I had the wrong idea about you.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:13.81,0:13:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for that. I really am.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:17.78,0:13:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't regret having used my wish for someone else.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:22.41,0:13:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided never to regret my actions,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:24.69,0:13:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,so as not to cheapen the feelings I cherish.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:26.89,0:13:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Never again.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:27.92,0:13:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:30.34,0:13:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe I paid too high a price.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:35.46,0:13:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do wonderful things with this power, if I use it right.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:41.81,0:13:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And what about you?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:43.98,0:13:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you get those apples?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:47.80,0:13:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get the\Nmoney to pay for them?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:55.02,0:13:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't tell me, can you?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:56.78,0:14:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I can't eat them.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.54,0:14:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't even want one.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:05.04,0:14:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You dumbass!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:06.16,0:14:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're magical girls!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:08.78,0:14:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one else like us!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:11.42,0:14:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will continue to fight in my own way.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:15.67,0:14:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If that interferes with your life,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:17.95,0:14:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you're welcome to try\Nand kill me again.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:20.70,0:14:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I no longer bear you any\Nill will, but nor will I lose.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:54.46,0:14:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Sayaka{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:57.46,0:14:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Sayaka{**-san}.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:02.99,0:15:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:06.91,0:15:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened yesterday?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:10.09,0:15:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just feeling a little unwell.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.10,0:15:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:14.11,0:15:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's okay. I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.62,0:15:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:19.99,0:15:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's get...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:26.24,0:15:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My, has Kamijou{**-kun} been\Nreleased from the hospital?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:38.63,0:15:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kamijou, are you okay\N to come to school?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:41.13,0:15:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It wouldn't be rehab if I was \Ncooped up in my home all day.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:44.89,0:15:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My goal is to walk without\N crutches by next week.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:48.64,0:15:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad Kamijou{**-kun}'s doing well.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:51.30,0:15:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:52.64,0:15:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}, go say hi.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:54.82,0:15:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't said anything\N to him yet, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:57.90,0:16:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm... okay for now.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:13.53,0:16:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what did you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:17.04,0:16:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I need some relationship advice.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:20.42,0:16:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been keeping something from you and Madoka{**-san} for a while now.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:25.78,0:16:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:26.64,0:16:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:28.85,0:16:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I've...
Dialogue: 5,0:16:32.04,0:16:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,been attracted to Kamijou Kyousuke{**-kun} for some time now.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:36.56,0:16:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:43.30,0:16:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I never would've expected\Nthat from you, Hitomi.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:45.48,0:16:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyousuke sure is a lucky guy—
Dialogue: 5,0:16:49.16,0:16:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You've known him for a long time, haven't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:52.91,0:16:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but we're just old acquaintances, I guess.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:58.42,0:17:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that really all?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:03.42,0:17:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I've decided that I won't lie to myself anymore.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:07.99,0:17:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:09.43,0:17:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-san}, can you accept your true feelings?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:13.93,0:17:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:16.56,0:17:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a precious friend to me.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:19.99,0:17:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So I don't want to steal him from you or try to court him behind your back.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:26.07,0:17:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You've spent far more time with him than I have.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:31.35,0:17:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you should have the right to go after him first.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:35.08,0:17:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitomi...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:37.08,0:17:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I will confess my love to Kamijou{**-kun} after school tomorrow.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:41.09,0:17:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You have one whole day.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:43.82,0:17:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please decide on a course of\Naction that you won't regret.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:47.50,0:17:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Decide whether or not you'll\N tell him how you feel.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.55,0:17:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:19.47,0:18:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:20.96,0:18:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I come with you?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:24.96,0:18:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to be all on your own.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:31.54,0:18:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:33.69,0:18:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so kind to me?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:36.95,0:18:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't deserve it.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:40.62,0:18:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:42.63,0:18:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, I almost regretted what I'd done.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:48.56,0:18:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,For just a moment, I wondered what would have happened if I hadn't saved Hitomi.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:54.89,0:18:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Some hero I turned out to be.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:57.83,0:19:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Mami{**-san} would be ashamed to have known me.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:08.02,0:19:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to lose Kyousuke to Hitomi!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:11.51,0:19:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And there's nothing I can do about it!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:14.53,0:19:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already dead!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:17.96,0:19:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a zombie!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:20.58,0:19:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I ask him to hold this dead body?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:24.19,0:19:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I ask him to kiss my cold lips?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:42.84,0:19:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:45.69,0:19:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:48.18,0:19:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:50.32,0:19:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel better.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:53.80,0:19:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's go. Those witches aren't gonna slay themselves.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:58.01,0:19:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:14.36,0:20:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you're\Njust sitting here watching.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.23,0:20:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,She's fighting a witch\Ntoday, not a familiar.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:21.91,0:20:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll drop a Grief Seed.\NIt's not a pointless hunt.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.13,0:20:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'd let her take\Nyour prey for that, huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:35.55,0:20:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that idiot.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:37.50,0:20:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She's having trouble.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:17.30,0:21:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:28.65,0:21:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Goddamnit. I couldn't\Njust sit there any longer.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:31.48,0:21:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stay back for now.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:33.84,0:21:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you how it's done.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:36.72,0:21:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:37.75,0:21:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:39.19,0:21:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do it myself.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:43.99,0:21:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{**-chan}!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:51.68,0:21:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:08.62,0:22:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:10.45,0:22:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If I just detach myself...
Dialogue: 5,0:22:15.60,0:22:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,it doesn't hurt at all!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:22.37,0:22:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop... Please stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.03,0:22:26.07,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.00,0:23:56.04,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 5,0:23:57.14,0:24:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}I won't be like the rest of you magical girls.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:00.22,0:24:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}That's what I've decided.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:01.97,0:24:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}I don't need any reward for my work.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:03.85,0:24:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}I'll never use magic for my own benefit.
Dialogue: 5,0:24:08.16,0:24:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}I really was an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.97,0:03:16.74,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I'll walk upon this Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.74,0:03:18.81,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}and pierce this shadowy veil of unease,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.81,0:03:22.42,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}as many times as necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.58,0:03:43.87,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}with these unwavering feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.72,0:03:59.56,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}the beautiful blue sky will always be waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.31,0:02:41.73,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,0)}I'll never forget the promises we exchanged
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.73,0:02:44.19,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I still see it when I close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.19,0:02:45.81,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I'll move forward as I cast off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.81,0:02:49.69,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}this darkness engulfing me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.97,0:03:05.80,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,480)}How long will it be before
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:11.97,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I see that lost future again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.56,0:04:01.85,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}So I won't be afraid
Dialogue: 6,0:04:01.85,0:04:07.98,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,1020)}No matter what happens next, I won't give in
